Model weights and data in this crate
- testdata/arena-mlp/ (heads.json, weights.json, weights.bin, fixture.json): a 2x128 MLP student for the Arena demo
  game, trained from scratch by Partii Games on synthetic game states and rule-teacher labels produced by our
  own code. No third-party weights, datasets or player data. Same licence as the crate (MIT OR Apache-2.0).
- The crate downloads no weights. Callers pass their own heads.json / weights.json / weights.bin.

Third-party code (dependencies, not included in this crate; fetched by Cargo under their own licences)
